---
layout: false
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="<%= page.lang || config.language || 'zh-TW' %>">

<head>
  <%- partial('_partial/google-analytics') %>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>
    <%= page.title %>
  </title>
  <%- partial('_partial/assets') %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="<%- url_for('assets/css/main.css') %>" />
  <style>
    body {
      opacity: 0;
    }

    body.loaded {
      opacity: 1;
      transition: opacity 0.8s ease;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body style="
    --bg-image: url('<%= url_for(page.bg || '/image/bg-base.jpg') %>');
    --bg-color: <%= page.bgColor || 'rgba(35,36,61,0.9)' %>;
    --bg-blend: <%= page.bgBlend || 'multiply' %>;
    --text-color: <%= page.textColor || '#f0f0f0' %>;
    --text-color-hover: <%= page.textColorHover || '#f0f0f099' %>;
  ">

  <main id="home" class="flex justify-center items-center">
    <section class="">
      <video class="home-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata">
        <source src="<%= url_for('video/light.mp4') %>" type="video/mp4">
      </video>
      <div class="home-content container">
        <div class="h-full flex flex-col flex-3">
          <div>
            <h1>夜明曉更前</h1>
            <h3>Anyway Before Dawn</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-auto">
            <p>
              這是給予你，同是留給自己的音信。<br>
              生命不過是片刻的流浪，橫過幽谷行經荒蕪，繞走兩圈又回到原處。<br>
              在無助的年歲裡揮霍，搖擺於岔路，而也許最終都將成為虛無。<br><br>
              雖然不知道停泊於此的理由，仍然找不到啟程的方向。<br>
              但希望至少有那麼一瞬間，你能從我的故事裡想起那些似曾相識的縮影。<br><br>
              也願在黎明前的夜色裡，能化作搖籃去承載你我的悲傷。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pageBtnBox flex-2 h-full">
          <p>遠方似乎有什麼吸引了你的目光<br>
            接下來，想要往前往何處呢？</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <script>
    window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
      document.body.classList.add('loaded');
    })
  </script>
</body>

</html>